  "_notes": [
    "The sound table. Each entry is one moment of the game. 'pick' is what plays: one or more sound files (several: one is taken at random each time). An empty pick is silence.",
    "File names are those of the Fate of the Galaxy sounds folder, without '.wav'. 'candidates' are other files that could fit: listen to them in that folder and move the ones you like into 'pick'.",
    "The cockpit loops (engine.cockpit.*) play at 10% of the volume when the selected ship stands still, rising to 40% at its top speed; their 'volume' here is on top of that (1 = leave it alone).",
    "'volume' is 0 to 1. 'max' cuts a long sound after that many seconds (with a fade). 'ships' says which ships an entry is for (weapons and engines).",
    "After changing picks run:  npm run sounds  (it converts the picked files into public/assets/sounds; set FOTG_SOUNDS to the mod's sounds folder if it has moved).",
    "The ids are used by the game (src/ui/sound.ts, src/ui/soundmap.ts): change picks, volumes and ship lists freely, but not the ids."
